# Code-only repository: track source, configs, scripts and markdown notes.
# Everything else (data, checkpoints, results, meshes, paper) stays local.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.cfg
!*.bat
!*.sh
!*.md
!*.yml
!.gitignore

# Never tracked
__pycache__/
/data/
/docs/
/paper
/graphify-out/
/.claude/
/.vscode/
/CLAUDE.md
/EXTRAPOLATION/
/INTERPOLATION/
/runs/
/revision/data/
/revision/checkpoints/
/revision/results/
/revision/logs/
# third-party baseline repo (has its own git + license)
/Compattators/FaceCom_repo/
/Compattators/FaceCom/coma_dataset/
/Compattators/FaceCom/checkpoints_coma/

# Small split files needed to reproduce the experiments
!/splits/coma_official_test.txt
!/research/revision/exp2_subj_expr/split.json
